  m_text: "I\u2019M STELIOS, AN INDIE GAME DEVELOPER, AND I\u2019M THRILLED TO SHARE
    MY FIRST HORROR GAME AFTER A YEAR OF SOLO WORK.\n\nFROM GAME DESIGN AND PROGRAMMING
    TO UI, AUDIO, LIGHTING, TESTING, MARKETING AND MORE\u2014I\u2019VE DONE IT ALL
    MYSELF.\n\nA LOT OF THANKS TO MY FAMILY, FRIENDS, AND THE AMAZING COMMUNITY FOR
    YOUR SUPPORT. DON\u2019T FORGET TO SHARE YOUR FEEDBACK \u2014 IT REALLY HELPS
    ME FIX BUGS AND IMPROVE THE GAME!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"
